    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5jj",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ji",
          "text": "How a Denver Pet Insurance Bad Faith Lawyer Can Help",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5jo",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5jl",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/denver-insurance-bad-faith-lawyer/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5jk",
          "text": "Pet insurance companies are large corporations that can make powerful adversaries if you encounter an issue with your claim. The best way to protect your rights and level the playing field is by hiring a lawyer to represent you. A ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5jm",
          "text": "bad faith insurance lawyer",
          "marks": [
            "l5jl"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5jn",
          "text": " will know how to go up against a pet insurance company on your behalf and advocate for the financial benefits you deserve for your pet’s care based on the language of your policy. You can trust your lawyer to read and explain the terms of your pet insurance policy, identify the signs of insurance bad faith, file a claim against the insurer, and fight for the case outcome that you deserve.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5jq",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5jp",
          "text": "When Is a Pet Insurance Company Acting in Bad Faith?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5js",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5jr",
          "text": "Pet insurance companies must act under an implied covenant of good faith and fair dealing. This means they have a responsibility to process claims in a fair, honest and good faith attempt to resolve them based on the language of the policy and applicable insurance laws. Failing to do so is known as bad faith, which can entitle a policyholder to file a lawsuit against the pet insurance company.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5ju",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5jt",
          "text": "Examples of pet insurance company bad faith include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5jw",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5jv",
          "text": "Misrepresenting the contract terms and provisions at the time of purchase.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5jy",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5jx",
          "text": "Failing to warn a policyholder ahead of a lapse in coverage.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5k0",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5jz",
          "text": "Delaying a pet insurance claim without a valid reason.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5k2",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5k1",
          "text": "Refusing to offer a fair and reasonable settlement to a claimant.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5k4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5k3",
          "text": "Denying a viable claim without justification (wrongful claim denial).",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5k6",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5k5",
          "text": "Any of these acts could provide grounds for a claim against the pet insurer for bad faith. A pet insurance bad faith claim could result in financial compensation not only for your original claim damages but also for the inconvenience caused by the insurer’s bad faith tactics. A pet insurance bad faith claim in Colorado could help you obtain the financial benefits you need to pay for your pet’s care.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5k8",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5k7",
          "text": "Contact a Denver Pet Insurance Bad Faith Lawyer",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5kd",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l5ka",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "/contact/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5k9",
          "text": "Pet insurance should give you peace of mind regarding your beloved pets – not stress or a headache when it comes time to file a claim and seek the benefits you have been paying for. If you encounter pet insurance bad faith after filing a claim in Denver, ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5kb",
          "text": "contact the attorneys",
          "marks": [
            "l5ka"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5kc",
          "text": " at Dormer Harpring for legal advice.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b5kf",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s5ke",
          "text": "We will review your case for free and let you know if you have grounds to file a pet insurance bad faith claim. If so, we can help you go up against a pet insurance company to pursue justice and fair financial compensation. Call (303) 756-3812 today to schedule your free case consultation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
